{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook","id":916510,"title":"The Uncrucified, An Eclipse Caste Fanfiction (Text + Podfic/Audiobook)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-17T17:36:34-07:00","id":916510,"title":"The Uncrucified, An Eclipse Caste Fanfiction (Text + Podfic/Audiobook)","content":"I've been wanting to write more for a long time now, but my day job always got in the way and I found the task very intimidating. Playing Exalted provided just the inspirational punch in the face I needed to create not only a short story about my Eclipse Caste's Exaltation, but an audiobook as well! I'm excited to share this creation where more Exalted fans might be able to see and enjoy it.<br /> <br /> I'll be sharing one chapter a week until it's been fully posted. Half of the story (4 of the 8 total chapters) have already been shared online. I'll post here when new chapters go live, for those who want to keep up. Give it a read/listen and let me know your thoughts! <div align=\"center\"><br /> <b>SUMMARY: </b><i>Whispers of The Uncrucified lie on the lips of every slave in Gem, Chiaroscuro, Nexus and beyond. She is Kalara Vadras, Chosen of the Unconquered Sun and bringer of the Eclipse. Some say she is a murderer, an Anathema, a Deceiver. Others know the truth written in her own words and passed along to those who dare keep such a heretical tome in their possession. Read on, if you have the courage to see the world for what it really is.</i><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#8B4513\">Reading and listening links can be found </span><u><a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#8B4513\">here</span></a></u><span style=\"color:#8B4513\">.</span></b><br /> <br /> <b>EDIT: </b><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">I'm also working on a completely expanded and revised version of this short story.<br /> Check out the early Alpha draft at the reader feedback blog </span><u><a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">HERE</span></a></u><span style=\"color:#800000\">!</span></b><br /> <br /> </div> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://orig00.deviantart.net/5fe8/f/2016/146/d/e/the_uncrucified_wattpad_cover_by_angelasasser-da3uvrh.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 06-15-2017, 06:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T23:14:50-07:00","id":916680,"title":"","content":"Ooh, thank you! <i>Exalted</i> is probably my favorite fandom, but the main fansite for it died a while ago, and none of the big fanfic archives have anything but poorly-written smut.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-18T06:26:41-07:00","id":916796,"title":"","content":"Cool! I love fanfiction. Glad to see you're posting it here. \ud83d\ude01","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5574-volatilesublime","name":"VolatileSublime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5574_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-18T06:57:02-07:00","id":916806,"title":"","content":"That everything is amazing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-18T07:17:36-07:00","id":916813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=916680#post916680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooh, thank you! <i>Exalted</i> is probably my favorite fandom, but the main fansite for it died a while ago, and none of the big fanfic archives have anything but poorly-written smut.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sad to hear there was a fansite that died! There's so much potential for cool art and stories in this world, it'd be nice if there was a well organized central place to share it. I've found a couple of fan groups on DeviantART, but that's about as close as I've found a place to share besides the Exalted sub-reddit and here.<br /> <br /> While smut has its place (oh EXXXalted), this one is most certainly drama (just in case anyone was wondering).<br /> <br /> Thanks for the responses thus far, guys! I'm so glad there might actually be readers for this now beyond my own circle of fellow players and close friends that I nag.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-18T10:49:49-07:00","id":916904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angelicshadow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=916813#post916813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sad to hear there was a fansite that died! There's so much potential for cool art and stories in this world, it'd be nice if there was a well organized central place to share it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, <a href=\"http://www.thefreedomstone.com/phpBB3/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">it's</a> not <i>dead</i> dead, it's just that very few people upload anything on it anymore. The site is still there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-18T23:16:21-07:00","id":917199,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Bit late for me to dive in now, but I'm looking forward to it tomorrow!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Good night sweet Green Sun Prince: And flights of demons beat thee to thy rest...with billyclubs! <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/362-darkon","name":"Darkon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar362_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-18T23:19:13-07:00","id":917201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=916904#post916904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, <a href=\"http://www.thefreedomstone.com/phpBB3/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">it's</a> not <i>dead</i> dead, it's just that very few people upload anything on it anymore. The site is still there.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was there not long ago myself. Just poking around a bit. I'm glad I snagged the webcomic that was on there before it disappeared from teh webz foreves. It may have been the first Exalted web comic evah!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Good night sweet Green Sun Prince: And flights of demons beat thee to thy rest...with billyclubs! <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/362-darkon","name":"Darkon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar362_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T00:08:20-07:00","id":917217,"title":"","content":"I just realized that I've seen <a href=\"http://angelasasser.deviantart.com/art/Persephone-Queen-of-the-Underworld-290633739\" target=\"_blank\">OP's original art</a> before. It's really innovative!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T01:25:42-07:00","id":917236,"title":"","content":"I really enjoyed this fan fic.<br /> 10x <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4939-adimar","name":"adimar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4939_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T07:02:47-07:00","id":919074,"title":"","content":"It's release day and <b>Chapter 5</b> is now live! I'll be dropping a chapter every Wednesday until the story's completion.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">SUMMARY:</span></b><i> Life goes on and Kalara struggles to find her place in the world. She cannot ignore the plight of those still trapped in a past she was liberated from, and yet, she must move forward through the cutthroat drudgery of the Guild if she is to have any future at all. Doubts in Ahrun\u2019s purpose still plague her while the Guild has its own machinations in store.</i></span></div><b><img src=\"http: