<br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T08:09:42-07:00","id":927066,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The day of destiny is upon us - release day! This is the scene that started it all. A failed reformer, the shadow of the Eclipse. Kalara was born in my imagination within this scene of martyrdom and inversion of fate. <b>The final chapter is coming next Wednesday!</b></span></span></span><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><b>SUMMARY: </b><i> With her efforts for Guild reform destroyed, the consequences fall on Kalara\u2019s head. The executioner awaits with none to act on her behalf,\u2026save for one. They would call this the Day of Black Sun, a day that would bring fear and hope to the people in turns.</i></span></span></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><i><img src=\"http://67.media.tumblr.com/90f16530924105ff09e6e7b01ccfd3d9/tumblr_o9wdbr9i9j1rruah5o1_r1_500.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></i></span></span></span></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:21px\">Reading Links:</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wattpad.com%2Fmyworks%2F73086029%2Fwrite%2F280407211&amp;t=YjQ3ZjFiZDg0YjUwYjFjMzZhNDY5OGZhOTE2NWIzMjc1Yjg3ZTkwMSxCV3N5SnF3NQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On Wattpad</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fanfiction.net%2Fs%2F11964331%2F7%2FThe-Uncrucified&amp;t=N2NiZDVhZWQwNzliNmJmMjFhOTJmNmQ0MDM2YmRjMzNmMTNmNTgxMyxCV3N5SnF3NQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On Fanfiction.net</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=http%3A%2F%2Fangelasasser-story.deviantart.com%2Fart%2FThe-Uncrucified-Ch-7-Black-Sun-619925525&amp;t=ZTY0MmYzYmRkODNhNmRhMTAxYjYwYmNiNTIwYzE1MTAyNjU1ZmZjOCxCV3N5SnF3NQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On DeviantArt</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:21px\">Listening Links:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fplaylist%3Flist%3DPLtCr3gkJirVQw4BHQj5HzXmTdUhO6Wd1Z&amp;t=NGE4NzdhZmE3YzkwMWE4YTQxOTkwMzliZWY5MDYyZTZhNGM0Y2M1Nyx4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On YouTube</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Fangelasasser%2Fsets%2Fthe-uncrucified-an-exalted&amp;t=N2ZlNzk3ZjQ3Yjk5YzE1MWE0NzcyOWNiNzcxZDA3ZTFjMTRhY2IwYix4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On Soundcloud</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fitunes.apple.com%2Fus%2Fpodcast%2Funcrucified-exalted-podfic%2Fid1119602436&amp;t=MjQ3YmFhNmIxMDdhOThjODc3ZmQxNDUzZmU2ZDYwOGIyYjkyYjk0NCx4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On iTunes</a></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 07-07-2016, 02:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T06:06:06-07:00","id":927581,"title":"","content":"So, one minor piece of feedback; the description of Kalara's crucifixion leans perhaps a little too heavily on the audience's knowledge of what crucifixion is, and in particular the Christian image of crucifixion. A paragraph of Karala reflecting on her fate, and/or some earlier descriptions in the story of crucified criminals, would go a long ways towards addressing this.<br /> <br /> I mean, there's a lot to be said for leaving things to the audience's imagination, but I actually had to read the section twice to be certain that Kalara *was* being crucified- the term is never event explicitly used in the chapter about her crucifixion, and<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chapter 7</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I shook my head again, no. I had no more tears left. No. I would spend my last moments satisfied in my final, tiny rebellion. I think I smiled then as the executioner drew his arm back to make the fateful strike\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>made me think Kalara was literally on the verge of being killed, whereas crucifixion is an especially horrifying punishment for the time it takes to kill the victims.<br /> <br /> (Note: Critique coming from a place of admiration for the overall work!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T06:40:35-07:00","id":927591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=927581#post927581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, one minor piece of feedback; the description of Kalara's crucifixion leans perhaps a little too heavily on the audience's knowledge of what crucifixion is, and in particular the Christian image of crucifixion. A paragraph of Karala reflecting on her fate, and/or some earlier descriptions in the story of crucified criminals, would go a long ways towards addressing this.<br /> <br /> I mean, there's a lot to be said for leaving things to the audience's imagination, but I actually had to read the section twice to be certain that Kalara *was* being crucified- the term is never event explicitly used in the chapter about her crucifixion, and...)</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey there! Thanks for the feedback, which I totally encourage any and all readers to leave here!<br /> <br /> My intention with that particular description was that she knew when that 2nd stake went in, that she was in for a long and gruesome experience whose one and only outcome was a painful death. Even if it happens later, it was inevitable. The 'fateful strike' was referring to the driving of the final stake that would prevent her from being mercy killed if she confessed, an act whose finality meant she really and truly was going to suffer and die awfully.<br /> <br /> I kept the experience more focused on her internalization of it, so she wouldn't be analyzing the entire process (nailed to wood beams, hoisted up to suffer, eventually killed by broken legs that cause asphyxiation), BUT I think a clever way to address this that doesn't throw people out of the turmoil might be to have her remember having seen other crucifixion victims in the same square upon her first arrival (when she first realizes where her execution is taking place) and go into more description there.<br /> <br /> Thanks again! I think you're right this scene needs some clarification and I will be editing it when I get the chance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 07-07-2016, 10:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T07:53:51-07:00","id":927617,"title":"","content":"Aaand now Chapter 7's text and audiobook versions have been edited for clarification! I think it works so much better now. Thanks to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar169_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"169\" data-vbnamecard=\"169\">wastevens</a> for that. Hooray for slow mornings!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T09:31:20-07:00","id":927649,"title":"","content":"That definitely scans better now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T11:53:33-07:00","id":927719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=927649#post927649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That definitely scans better now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for taking the time out to read and give me crit. Glad to know folks are reading (and hopefully enjoying) this!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T08:01:17-07:00","id":930846,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Here we are at the <b>final chapter </b>of The Uncrucified!<br /> <br /> It\u2019s been exciting sharing this short story with everyone. Being inspired to write this came as a total surprise. I was always too busy or had other stories that needed my attention, but sometimes, the muse spearheads something into our imaginations, something empowering and hopeful that cannot be ignored!<br /> <br /> Exalted lets us be heroes beyond imagination who ignore the boundaries of reality. Sometimes we need that escapism in a world where we feel powerless.</span></span></span><br /> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">During these unsettling times, Kalara\u2019s closing thoughts feel especially relevant:</span></span></span></div> </div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><img src=\"http://67.media.tumblr.com/32e638f54d9fc93af8f5a8de5b1b29fd/tumblr_oa9chlnZ9I1rruah5o1_r1_500.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span></div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">Chapter 8 Reading Links:</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wattpad.com%2F261839763-the-uncrucified-entry-i-a-cautionary-tale&amp;t=YzQ0M2UxMTY3NmM0MzMwMmIzMWYxYjU1MDljNWQxYzhjMmU5NzljNixzeXQySnlHMw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On Wattpad</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fanfiction.net%2Fs%2F11964331%2F1%2FThe-Uncrucified&amp;t=ZDE2OTViZDU2MmJiNjlmNjYzODc5ZjZmMTQxYjQ1MmE1NGNiMTA0Nix4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On Fanfiction.net</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=http%3A%2F%2Fangelasasser-story.deviantart.com%2Fart%2FThe-Uncrucified-Ch-1-A-Cautionary-Tale-611156265&amp;t=NDQ2MTdiODRkMWVhMzU0MGU0NTc1ZmUwY2Y4ZTNmYTYzN2IzYzNhMixzeXQySnlHMw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On DeviantArt</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=http%3A%2F%2Farchiveofourown.org%2Fworks%2F6753754%2Fchapters%2F15474304&amp;t=ODNlODdjZmNkMjM5ZGVjMTAzNWM3ZjdmNzc4NzMzNzhkZDNjYzBjMyx1TWwzUGNrVQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On AO3 (Archive of Our Own)</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:21px\">Audiobook Links:</span><br /> <br /> - <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fplaylist%3Flist%3DPLtCr3gkJirVQw4BHQj5HzXmTdUhO6Wd1Z&amp;t=NGE4NzdhZmE3YzkwMWE4YTQxOTkwMzliZWY5MDYyZTZhNGM0Y2M1Nyx4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On YouTube</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Fangelasasser%2Fsets%2Fthe-uncrucified-an-exalted&amp;t=N2ZlNzk3ZjQ3Yjk5YzE1MWE0NzcyOWNiNzcxZDA3ZTFjMTRhY2IwYix4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On Soundcloud</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- <a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fitunes.apple.com%2Fus%2Fpodcast%2Funcrucified-exalted-podfic%2Fid1119602436&amp;t=MjQ3YmFhNmIxMDdhOThjODc3ZmQxNDUzZmU2ZDYwOGIyYjkyYjk0NCx4cVdGRkcxdA%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">On iTunes</a></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 07-13-2016, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T08:42:45-07:00","id":932028,"title":"","content":"Now that this story is finished, I've created a <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">nice little landing page</a> where you guys can get PDF and EPUB files for tablet readers. These files include all chapters of the story with footnotes of lore. Plus sharing some of the art I've done for this story there as well.<br /> <br /> I doubt I'm done with Kalara! It seems her adventures as Koh could be interesting material to mine. I sense a sequel coming on when I can scratch out the time to make one. The adventures of her years as the Silver-Tongued Devil would be so much fun to explore! <br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://67.media.tumblr.com/e92dcfeaa7aab25a5c1de98d9deca7d7/tumblr_oad187FtOw1rruah5o1_540.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 07-15-2016, 11:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-15T08:45:15-07:00","id":932029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angelicshadow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=932028#post932028\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I doubt I'm done with Kalara! It seems her adventures as Koh could be interesting material to mine. I sense a sequel coming on when I can scratch out the time to make one. The adventures of her years as the Silver-Tongued Devil would be so much fun to explore!\\</div> </div> </div> </div>Yay! And ten characters!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T21:12:09-07:00","id":932779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/916510-the-uncrucified-an-eclipse-caste-fanfiction-text-podfic-audiobook?p=932029#post932029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yay! And ten characters!</div> </div> </div> </div>I can definitely see there being a lot more people involved while she's building a crimin-...I mean righteous mercantile empire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T08:43:44-07:00","id":996626,"title":"","content":"So it's <b>National Novel Writing Month</b> and I've decided to participate this month by writing a sequel to The Uncrucified! Feel free to keep up with the unedited NaNoWriMo excerpts over at <a href=\"http://theprojectfairy.tumblr.com/tagged/NaNoWriMo-2016\" target=\"_blank\">my writing tumblr</a>. You can also add me as a writing buddy over at <a href=\"http://nanowrimo.org/participants/angelasasser/novels/the-uncrucified-the-silver-tongued-devil\" target=\"_blank\">my NaNoWriMo profile</a>. I'm excited to get back to writing about this character, as she's really captured my muse! Here's a little tidbit to tease you guys for the sequel: <hr /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>The Sun Prince tilted his head in acknowledgement, a golden sigil burned into the air in front of his forehead, a circle within a corona, the mark of the Eclipse. At that, all creatures, mortal and immortal, bowed to him, honoring his glory and the reign of prosperity that would shine favor upon the city for centuries to come now that the East was his. Before Kalara would ever learn the name of Calymm, she would know his face in dreams, the face of the one whose power had passed to her upon her choosing.</i><br /> <br /> <i>His purpose, his ambition, was now hers. Seeing through his eyes, she gazed across the prostrate figures basking in her splendor, feeling his grandiose aura sweeping over all in the hall. The patterns of creation wove themselves unseen, all entangled at his fingers. The slightest tug could cause a shortage of food in Varsi. A little pull could cause a rebellion in Matetha. The East would be her foothold into a great empire where not even The Guild could stop her. This power was hers now\u2026</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u2026and then the uncomfortable pillow of a rock woke her from her reverie and reminded her that even those with great destinies could get kinks in their necks when they slept in ditches under bridges.</i></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T17:39:14-07:00","id":1069737,"title":"","content":"Now that I've written about 3/4ths of a sequel to this story, I'm finding myself wanting to rewrite this story completely! I'm thinking of expanding on what's there by making it 3rd person and adding a little more flesh on the bones of what's already there.<br /> <br /> <b>This is where I need your help! If you've read this story, how would you like to see it expanded?</b> <br /> <br /> Are there any specific characters or scenes you'd like to see more of? Any other feedback? Personally, I'd love to expand upon Ahrun, as well as explore the idea of a Guild academy even further. There's so much potential for expansion in that bit alone! Plus, there are a few areas where certain people who have a certain impact on Kalara's life who come in towards the end with little warning. That certain someone is definitely deserving of more foreshadowing!<br /> <br /> So this is IT! Your crazy opportunity to give me a wishlist of what YOU'D like to see! I'm going to tag a few people I know who read this story or seemed interested in it, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar169_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"169\" data-vbnamecard=\"169\">wastevens</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"476\" data-vbnamecard=\"476\">Argonometra</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5574-volatilesublime\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5574_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5574\" data-vbnamecard=\"5574\">VolatileSublime</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/362-darkon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar362_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"362\" data-vbnamecard=\"362\">Darkon</a>, and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4939-adimar\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4939_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4939\" data-vbnamecard=\"4939\">adimar</a>. I offer you the sneak peek of a work in progress rough draft of the sequel in your inbox as 'payment', if you can find the time to provide any feedback. It would be ever so helpful!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T09:53:49-07:00","id":1070166,"title":"","content":"I enjoyed listening to the podcast.<br /> <br /> The transition at the end from Kalara, ex slave/guildee to Koh the Bandit was pretty quick. I would like to see more time given to that transition. The story doesn't need to go further in the timeline, but some space dedicated to character switch would be nice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Enjoy the adventures of a socially awkward Godblooded that tries to make her way through the world.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1055342-halfway-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Halfway</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11319-finn523","name":"Finn523","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T10:44:45-07:00","id":1070197,"title":"","content":"Hey <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11319-finn523\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11319\" data-vbnamecard=\"11319\">Finn523</a> thanks for dropping in to leave your thoughts! As fate would have it, the sequel I've been working on follows directly after the end of this story and explores the period of Kalara's journey setting up the persona of Koh. The amount of fun I've been having in this sequel, which is written in the 3rd person POV with many more characters and details, has me wanting to go back and rewrite this one the same way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T10:31:12-07:00","id":1075170,"title":"","content":"<b>The great draft revision has BEGUN! </b>Luck would have it that Camp NaNoWriMo started up this month, which has been excellent motivation for me to revise this story and create art inspired by The Uncrucified! You can keep up with excerpts and art <a href=\"http://theprojectfairy.tumblr.com/tagged/NaNoWriMoTheUncrucified\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> Here's a tease of an image from my Camp NaNoWriMo adventures:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theprojectfairy.tumblr.com/post/159324478671/camp-nanowrimo-day-7-sana-of-house-cynis-clocked\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://68.media.tumblr.com/6a197f57229d89e745d5ff862a34ec43/tumblr_oo2nplh6MY1rruah5o1_r1_540.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 04-08-2017, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T12:32:57-07:00","id":1085531,"title":"","content":"For those following along with this story, I've made a <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/TheUncrucified/\" target=\"_blank\">dedicated subreddit</a> for it over at Reddit. Just another way to keep up with art and things for it! Plus, I'd love to feature any fan works inspired by it there, as I've gotten a couple of cool arts from folks that I've already shared. I'm always happy to signal boost! Enjoy! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Meanwhile, I'm almost done with <a href=\"http://theprojectfairy.tumblr.com/tagged/The-Uncrucified\" target=\"_blank\">my Camp NaNoWriMo experience</a> where I've been working on a HUGE revision of this story. It's been an awesome experience thus far that's produced some nice scenes and inspired a few character sketches! I'll share a wrap-up post with all the art and story excerpts in this thread once it's finished.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T07:56:03-07:00","id":1086198,"title":"","content":"WOOHOO Camp NaNoWriMo is over and what a wild ride it's been! I've majorly re-written about 3rd of Kalara's memoir and developed quite a few exciting ideas for how to flesh this tale out till its completion. If you're curious for teases of the next draft, I've put all the excerpts in one place <a href=\"http://theprojectfairy.tumblr.com/post/160191993961/camp-nanowrimo-apr-2017-wrap-up\" target=\"_blank\">on my writing tumblr</a>.<br /> <br /> Once I finish up this first major arc of the story, I hope to get some initial feedback on it from anyone who might be interested! Will poke here again once I'm at that point. Till then, enjoy the teases!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T17:32:58-07:00","id":1088563,"title":"","content":"I forgot to share this WONDERFUL fan art of Kalara and her alter-ego, Koh, here. <a href=\"http://theprojectfairy.tumblr.com/post/158814769941/raeliyah-gift-art-of-theprojectfairy-s-eclipse\" target=\"_blank\">Raeliyah</a>did such an awesome job!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://68.media.tumblr.com/6ada7237ac82d9ec0f74d895b4c75f7b/tumblr_on5sdlJsna1sccyhco1_1280.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T08:14:05-07:00","id":1103500,"title":"","content":"Enjoy more art inspired by The Uncrucified! <a href=\"http://rage-halo.deviantart.com\" target=\"_blank\">Rage-Halo</a> did this lovely commission piece for me of Kalara.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://pre01.deviantart.net/18a9/th/pre/f/2017/158/f/d/_commission__kalara_vadras_by_rage_halo-dbbwbhu.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T11:22:39-07:00","id":1112803,"title":"","content":"I put together an inspiration guide to Gem to help me visualize the area for the latest rewrite of The Uncrucified. You can see my write-up on Gem plus other design notes <a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/07/visual-guide-city-of-gem.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <i><a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/07/visual-guide-city-of-gem.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6cFgxcOdQdI/WV5ewQa3ZPI/AAAAAAAACQM/Ez56B_z8H1o4cCAZuaC1Q_a_C7KAs5dZQCLcBGAs/s640/Visual%2BGuide%2B-%2BCity%2Bof%2BGem%2B1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/07/visual-guide-city-of-gem.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-5pTAgH7JoW4/WV5l6AJUuSI/AAAAAAAACQk/pCT9vf6393Qruk96OrVzqua10REvt6ghgCLcBGAs/s640/Visual%2BGuide%2B-%2BCity%2Bof%2BGem%2B2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T09:20:27-07:00","id":1118591,"title":"","content":"<b>Head's up for anyone who has been following The Uncrucified.</b> I've finally entered the <span style=\"color:#8B4513\"><b>beta phase</b></span> of the first story arc on the massive expansion/rewrite I've been doing of the original memoir! You can start reading it <a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/search/label/The%20Uncrucified%20Beta%20Draft\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> Being in beta form, some things might still change by the final release, but this is pretty close to the quality level and style I want for Kalara's tale!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T13:25:59-07:00","id":1121486,"title":"","content":"Another update for those interested in the beta draft. I've now made ebook file formats available for your convenience. Find them <a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/p/ebook.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Happy reading!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-14T08:43:08-08:00","id":1348486,"title":"","content":"Been a minute since I updated here! Have some adorable chibi art of Kalara drawn by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3080-redkite7\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3080_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3080\" data-vbnamecard=\"3080\">redkite7</a> . I love the little details in this, from her phoenix belt buckle (the phoenix being the symbol of her new Guild) to the really cool wardrobe Sam made for her. LOVE! You can go give this piece all the love on Twitter <a href=\"https://twitter.com/milvusrae/status/1186349409082269701\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <i>\u201cOh did you think I didn\u2019t notice those disreputable dealings? Sorry, darling, but you\u2019ve been outbid! If you have bad luck settling paperwork for unknown reasons for the next 5 centuries, you know who to thank.\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-DC0OkMF-B00/Xc2Ay-ZzQ_I/AAAAAAAADlA/9HhAJieJmdIwwSpJIKboz33bo90jVBZzgCLcBGAsYHQ/s1600/chibikalara.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}